{"id":"6573959f436f68000f8816e3","slug":"rembrandt-van-rijn-the-presentation-in-the-temple-with-the-angel","title":"The Presentation in the Temple with the Angel","artists":["Rembrandt van Rijn"],"date":"ca. 1630","medium":"Etching on paper","dimensions":"4 × 3 in","image":"CrScrQYTSelwHeBCzUDVUg","c":["#3e322a","#ab9175","#b7a088"],"said":[{"k":"note","q":"This superb etching, entitled The Presentation in the Temple with the Angel, displays the artistry and detail for which Rembrandt's prints are renowned. In this work, Rembrandt depicts one of the few events from Christ's childhood recorded in the Bible, his presentation as an infant in the Temple, recounted in Luke 2:22-40.","by":"M.S. Rau, on Artsy"}],"events":[{"k":"made","y":"1630","c":1,"q":"ca. 1630","o":1,"s":[0]},{"k":"made","y":"1630","n":"printed","c":1,"q":"Printed circa 1630","o":1,"s":[1]},{"k":"listed","y":"2023-12-08","who":"M.S. Rau","n":"listed by the gallery","ll":[29.9576,-90.0649],"w":"New Orleans, US","p":"new-orleans-us","pr":"office","o":2,"s":[0]},{"k":"written","who":"Bartsch","pg":"51","q":"Bartsch 51","o":1,"s":[1]},{"k":"written","who":"Hind","pg":"18","q":"Hind 18","o":2,"s":[1]},{"k":"written","who":"New Hollstein","pg":"54","q":"New Hollstein 54","o":3,"s":[1]}],"sources":[{"name":"Artsy","url":"https://www.artsy.net/artwork/rembrandt-van-rijn-the-presentation-in-the-temple-with-the-angel"},{"name":"M.S. Rau, on Artsy","url":"https://www.artsy.net/artwork/rembrandt-van-rijn-the-presentation-in-the-temple-with-the-angel"}],"threads":[{"id":"8a492195","k":"artist","name":"Rembrandt van Rijn","y":1633,"n":16}],"asof":"2026-10-01"}